{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "12 - The answer on screen",
  "description": "How streamed events become the timeline, the approval card and the final answer, and how the chat survives a reload.",
  "nextTour": "13 - Production",
  "steps": [
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/streaming/processor.py",
      "line": 475,
